      "text": "[6:00p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic moving out of VI is on the high side at the moment, as motorists throng out of the Island.\n\n- Ozumba Mbadiwe is slow from Kofo Abayomi inwards Law School, also quite slow from The Lagoon inward Bony Camp;\n- Adeola Odeku is slow inwards Ahmadu Bello Way intersection;\n- Slow on Ahmadu Bello way inwards Adeola Odeku intersection;\n- Trafic is slow inwards Eko Hotel Roundabout;\n- Akin Adesola is slow inwards Alfred Rewane.\n- Adetokunboh Ademola is good\n- Ajose Adeogun is good.\n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@Gidi_Traffic",
